param([Parameter(Mandatory=$true)][string]$ProjectPath,[Parameter(Mandatory=$true)][string]$FbModuleName,[Parameter(Mandatory=$true)][string]$MnmPath,[Parameter(Mandatory=$true)][string]$OutDir,[int]$TimeoutSeconds=120,[switch]$PlanOnly)
$ErrorActionPreference='Stop';$root=Split-Path -Parent (Split-Path -Parent $PSCommandPath);. (Join-Path $root 'Resolve-KvStudioOperatorScript.ps1');$runner=Resolve-KvStudioOperatorScriptPath -ScriptRoot $root -Name 'invoke_kv_flat_execution_plan.ps1' -Classes workflow_tool;$art=Join-Path $OutDir 'artifacts';New-Item -ItemType Directory -Force $art|Out-Null;$steps=@();foreach($g in @('ui_guard_usage','agent_boundary')){$d=Join-Path $art $g;$steps+=@{name="assert_$g";kind='gate';script_name="assert_kv_mvp_$g.ps1";classes=@('gate');arguments=@('-ScriptsRoot',$root,'-OutDir',$d);out_dir=$d}};$d=Join-Path $art 'program_body';$steps+=@{name='set_fb_program_body';kind='runner_child';script_name='set_fb_program_body_guarded.ps1';classes=@('runner_child_approved');arguments=@('-ProjectPath',$ProjectPath,'-FbModuleName',$FbModuleName,'-MnmPath',$MnmPath,'-OutDir',$d);out_dir=$d};$plan=@{ok=$true;schema_version=1;operation='set_kv_fb_program_body';project_path=$ProjectPath;run_root=$OutDir;artifact_root=$art;result_path=(Join-Path $OutDir 'program_body_workflow_result.json');timeout_seconds=$TimeoutSeconds;steps=$steps};$pp=Join-Path $OutDir 'execution_plan.json';$plan|ConvertTo-Json -Depth 10|Set-Content $pp -Encoding UTF8;if(!$PlanOnly){& powershell -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File $runner -PlanPath $pp -TimeoutSeconds $TimeoutSeconds;exit $LASTEXITCODE}
